ns that were once only seen in cinematic scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Never give up, Never surrender!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">This phrase is the central catchphrase of Oh! Robot and a philosophical message for all of us living in today\u2019s world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">It\u2019s also a motto I send to myself as a solo game developer a message straight to my heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.poster.avif?t=1768201074\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.webm?t=1768201074\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/1b2c8f77269c36ab19a08a66dfefa48c.mp4?t=1768201074\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/3dcf9cca738944e4870823e223beb0bc.avif?t=1768201074\" width=1560 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> [ Story Mode ]</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>3Level Difficulty System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The game offers three difficulty levels: Easy, Normal, and Hard. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As the difficulty increases, rampaging robots gain more health and attack power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">On Hard mode, the game follows a roguelite style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">if you die during gameplay, the story resets and you must start over from the beginning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Weapon Drop &amp; Stat System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Destroying rampaging robots may drop weapons at random. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each weapon comes with randomized stats hunt for the ultimate gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Weapon Upgrade System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Weapons can be upgraded up to five levels, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">with each upgrade granting random stats. Forge the ultimate weapon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Weapon Selling System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Sell unused weapons to earn currency, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">which can be used for weapon upgrades, HP recovery, and passive skill enhancements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Passive Skill Enhancement System</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Upgrade various passive skills to significantly boost your robot\u2019s performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/eba412465799f80d2a9593694b7c65a3.poster.avif?t=1768201074\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715770/extras/eba41246